{"cantica":"inferno","cantoNumber":8,"title":"Canto VIII","totalDuration":340.435,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"I should say, continuing my story, that long before\nwe reached the foot of that high tower,\nour eyes were drawn upward to its summit\nbecause of two small flames we saw burning there","startTime":0,"endTime":11.92,"words":[{"word":"I","start":0.16,"end":0.36},{"word":"should","start":0.36,"end":0.56},{"word":"say,","start":0.56,"end":1.28},{"word":"continuing","start":1.28,"end":1.92},{"word":"my","start":1.92,"end":2.2},{"word":"story,","start":2.2,"end":2.96},{"word":"that","start":2.96,"end":3.28},{"word":"long","start":3.28,"end":3.68},{"word":"before","start":3.68,"end":3.92},{"word":"we","start":3.92,"end":4.12},{"word":"reached","start":4.12,"end":4.48},{"word":"the","start":4.48,"end":4.64},{"word":"foot","start":4.64,"end":4.8},{"word":"of","start":4.8,"end":4.96},{"word":"that","start":4.96,"end":5.12},{"word":"high","start":5.12,"end":5.36},{"word":"tower,","start":5.36,"end":6.32},{"word":"our","start":6.32,"end":6.56},{"word":"eyes","start":6.56,"end":6.88},{"word":"were","start":6.88,"end":7.04},{"word":"drawn","start":7.04,"end":7.44},{"word":"upward","start":7.44,"end":7.84},{"word":"to","start":7.84,"end":8.04},{"word":"its","start":8.04,"end":8.24},{"word":"summit","start":8.24,"end":9},{"word":"because","start":9,"end":9.24},{"word":"of","start":9.24,"end":9.44},{"word":"two","start":9.44,"end":9.88},{"word":"small","start":9.88,"end":10.16},{"word":"flames","start":10.16,"end":10.72},{"word":"we","start":10.72,"end":10.88},{"word":"saw","start":10.88,"end":11.2},{"word":"burning","start":11.2,"end":11.64},{"word":"there","start":11.64,"end":11.92}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"In the distance, signals flashed back and forth—\nlights so far away they barely reached the eye.\nI turned to my guide, hungry for understanding:","startTime":11.92,"endTime":22,"words":[{"word":"In","start":12.001,"end":12.121},{"wo